    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Fake parent class.

When we have a fragment with no `BeautifulSoup` document object,
we can&apos;t evaluate `nth` selectors properly.  Create a temporary
fake parent so we can traverse the root element as a child.
</verbatim> </para>
